WEBVTT

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:08.070
<i>The white-throated needletail.</i>

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:10.320
<i>Its height is 20 centimeters</i>

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.360
<i>and it is able to blast along at 
a speed of 350 kilometers.</i>

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:14.610
<i>It is the great Idaten above the clouds.</i>

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:30.060
Thanks for buying us some time.

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:34.070
Thanks... but don't you 
sound a bit arrogant?

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:35.690
Heh. Well, yeah.

00:01:40.270 --> 00:01:42.180
I'm counting on you over there...

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:43.810
Keiji.

00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:04.720
I can see you.

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:02.510
<i>As usual, he runs.</i>

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:07.430
<i>Every day, without rest, 
he repeats this routine.</i>

00:04:09.020 --> 00:04:11.060
<i>As usual, he repeats.</i>

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:15.480
<i>He runs early in the morning 
while it's still dark,</i>

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:37.980
<i>because he likes the scenery 
that is visible from here.</i>

00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:52.960
<i>So plain.</i>

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:56.020
<i>His driving force is so modest.</i>

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:01.130
<i>That is this man.</i>

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:06.530
The new lightweight champion!

00:05:10.050 --> 00:05:14.640
Well, being the world 
champion is great and all...

00:05:14.640 --> 00:05:16.620
But you know, it's not very entertaining.

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:18.670
You always win by technicalities, right?

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:20.610
The spectators want to see

00:05:20.610 --> 00:05:24.350
some super flashy KO towards 
the end of the fight, ya know?

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:32.000
If only you had some frail, sick mother...

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:34.430
that might add some needed drama.

00:05:43.590 --> 00:05:45.690
All right, President. I'm off.

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:47.780
Right. See you next week.

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:49.820
Huh? You're going home?

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:51.200
At least let me treat you to dinner.

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:53.360
Sorry. Maybe next time.

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:54.830
If you'll excuse me.

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:03.210
Doesn't he always seem to 
go home early on Fridays?

00:06:36.030 --> 00:06:37.750
I'm home, Ma.

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:47.950
How ya feelin', Ma?

00:06:47.950 --> 00:06:49.260
Ah, Keiji.

00:06:51.460 --> 00:06:55.510
You don't have to come home every week.

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:57.400
Especially to this little 
island that has nothing.

00:06:57.400 --> 00:06:59.280
Well, you're here, Ma.

00:07:00.030 --> 00:07:03.020
Oh, I'll make some food. What do you want?

00:07:03.620 --> 00:07:05.980
The chef's best tagliolini with

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:10.730
Kuroge Wagyu beef tongue and 
purple yams imported from Sicily.

00:07:10.730 --> 00:07:12.360
Don't mess with me.

00:07:12.850 --> 00:07:16.700
I'm sure you're living and 
eating like a monk, as usual.

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:19.080
I'm trying to make it suit you better.

00:07:21.770 --> 00:07:23.740
Is the last ferry still at 4:30?

00:07:23.740 --> 00:07:24.500
Yep.

00:07:24.860 --> 00:07:28.260
And the world champion is using it.

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:31.190
You lack charisma!

00:07:31.190 --> 00:07:33.140
You know, beast-like star power.

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:34.600
Huh? A beast?

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:36.290
Yeah, a beast.

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:44.440
When your dad was young, 
he was something else.

00:07:44.780 --> 00:07:47.270
All he'd have to do is bite me, 
and I felt like I'd ovulate.

00:07:47.270 --> 00:07:49.090
Okay, seriously, stop.

00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:52.770
But really. Your dad was amazing.

00:07:52.770 --> 00:07:56.100
He gave me a wonderful 
son like you, after all.

00:07:57.400 --> 00:08:00.110
That would mean that you're 
amazing, too, Ma.

00:08:00.110 --> 00:08:04.040
Oh, please. Flattery'll 
get you nowhere, Keiji.

00:08:04.970 --> 00:08:05.980
It totally did.

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:08.390
Like what? What did it get you?

00:08:09.070 --> 00:08:10.260
Hurry and tell me.

00:08:37.680 --> 00:08:41.430
<b>This Year's Goal: 
Become The Super Featherweight Champ!!</b>

00:08:38.190 --> 00:08:41.210
Keiji, go ahead and take a bath.

00:08:41.210 --> 00:08:42.080
Right.

00:08:54.980 --> 00:08:55.850
Ma.

00:09:00.860 --> 00:09:01.800
Keiji?

00:09:08.280 --> 00:09:09.240
My...

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:14.720
retina might be detaching.

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:28.290
<b>One Year Later</b>

00:09:59.430 --> 00:10:01.260
Hello, Super Express Delivery here.

00:10:01.260 --> 00:10:04.410
Oh, Kei-chan. You're back at work?

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:07.920
You should have taken it easy a while longer.

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:11.040
There's no point just staying at home.

00:10:12.260 --> 00:10:15.770
Thanks for coming the other day.

00:10:16.290 --> 00:10:19.380
You don't have to thank me.

00:10:20.030 --> 00:10:23.880
Are you going to stay here, Kei-chan?

00:10:23.880 --> 00:10:26.370
You're not going to be a boxer again?

00:10:26.370 --> 00:10:30.810
Well... My eye is bad. 
I won't be able to box again.

00:10:31.170 --> 00:10:34.430
Why'd you have to bring up boxing?

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:40.950
Well, I thought he was going to try 
again, considering what happened.

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:42.510
<i>Onizuka Keiji-sama</i>

00:11:24.360 --> 00:11:25.350
I'm home.

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:32.370
And that is the outline of our plan.

00:11:33.280 --> 00:11:34.670
Onizuka Keiji-san,

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:37.800
we need your help.

00:11:41.610 --> 00:11:43.800
Mars, huh...

00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:48.290
I can't even imagine it.

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:51.070
There are a lot of risks involved but,

00:11:51.070 --> 00:11:54.440
if we succeed, we will 
be able to save many people.

00:11:57.900 --> 00:11:59.090
And...

00:12:00.340 --> 00:12:03.410
We'll be able to save you 
from your debt, as well.

00:12:08.860 --> 00:12:11.850
It appears you've researched 
everything about me.

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:14.330
Yes.

00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:20.780
The fact that I borrowed money 
to try every treatment possible?

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:24.440
And the fact that I was conned

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:26.870
by a person claiming he worked 
for some kind of association?

00:12:27.360 --> 00:12:28.400
Did you check that, too?

00:12:29.090 --> 00:12:30.010
Yes.

00:12:35.530 --> 00:12:37.830
But you know... I can't.

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:41.490
It's rather surprising to me, but...

00:12:42.090 --> 00:12:43.340
I don't have it anymore.

00:12:44.600 --> 00:12:46.120
I don't have a reason to fight.

00:12:50.570 --> 00:12:51.740
It's gone now.

00:13:01.630 --> 00:13:05.060
<i>Then at least have some dessert. </i>

00:13:07.280 --> 00:13:10.560
<i>You truly are a boxer.</i>

00:13:29.060 --> 00:13:30.690
I see...

00:13:31.720 --> 00:13:36.260
Keiji, take this opportunity to end your mother
 complex and stop living like a monk.

00:13:36.260 --> 00:13:38.810
Go find yourself a wife instead

00:13:38.810 --> 00:13:40.520
and make some friends.

00:13:41.910 --> 00:13:43.210
Onizuka Keiji-san,

00:13:43.770 --> 00:13:46.220
we need your help.

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:20.000
I have something like a 
request... or a condition.

00:14:21.870 --> 00:14:24.700
Can you choose the base organism

00:14:25.310 --> 00:14:26.620
for this procedure?

00:14:27.740 --> 00:14:29.640
There are compatibility issues involved.

00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:32.230
If you are compatible with a few types...

00:14:32.230 --> 00:14:34.710
It doesn't mean you'll get 
exactly what you might want,

00:14:34.710 --> 00:14:36.390
but you can choose from there.

00:14:41.800 --> 00:14:44.970
Well, if I can pick,

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:47.240
make it the one with the best...

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:49.570
Punch strength?

00:14:54.150 --> 00:14:56.010
With the best eyesight.

00:14:56.580 --> 00:14:59.970
<i>He wants to see the island where his 
mother sleeps from the main island.</i>

00:15:00.340 --> 00:15:05.340
<i>So plain... His driving force is so modest.</i>

00:15:05.690 --> 00:15:07.600
<i>That is this man.</i>

00:15:09.190 --> 00:15:12.570
<i>There are two reasons 
I'm facing you right now.</i>

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:17.640
<i>First, to protect the wonderful 
friends I only just gained.</i>

00:15:18.240 --> 00:15:19.890
<i>And the second is just due</i>

00:15:21.290 --> 00:15:23.870
<i>to the fact that I can't live any other way.</i>

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:26.800
<b>8th</b>

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:29.560
<b>Onizuka Keiji</b>

00:15:31.250 --> 00:15:32.420
Prepare yourself.

00:15:37.930 --> 00:15:40.040
<i>This insect does not camouflage itself.</i>

00:15:40.810 --> 00:15:43.860
<i>However, it is too hard 
to become prey.</i>

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:46.730
<i>Its wings are so hard that they won't open.</i>

00:15:47.310 --> 00:15:50.050
<i>This black orb that is 
under fifteen millimeters long</i>

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:53.180
<i>is known as one of the 
world's hardest insects.</i>

00:15:54.110 --> 00:15:57.600
<i>Its name: pachyrhynchus infernalis.</i>

00:15:58.830 --> 00:16:00.780
<i>This organism, on the other hand...</i>

00:16:00.780 --> 00:16:05.100
<i>The strategy it uses to feed 
upon prey with hard shells is</i>

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:07.110
<i>to smash them and break them open.</i>

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:15.610
<i>At fifteen centimeters, it has the 
same force as a .22 rifle.</i>

00:16:16.340 --> 00:16:19.300
<i>Its name: the peacock mantis shrimp.</i>

00:16:42.250 --> 00:16:46.200
<i>The mantis shrimp's eyesight is 
broader than a human's or an insect's.</i>

00:16:46.200 --> 00:16:48.090
<i>It is said that it can see</i>

00:16:48.090 --> 00:16:51.070
<i>ultraviolet and infrared 
rays, and even radio waves.</i>

00:16:51.630 --> 00:16:54.490
<i>In other words, it has 
terrifyingly good eyesight.</i>

00:16:57.120 --> 00:17:02.500
<i>Ma, you were always worried... 
because all I could do was box.</i>

00:17:04.310 --> 00:17:06.350
<i>I'll do it, for sure.</i>

00:17:06.870 --> 00:17:09.790
<i>When I go back to Earth and 
I can see your island,</i>

00:17:09.790 --> 00:17:12.510
<i>I'll live a life that can put you at ease.</i>

00:17:13.060 --> 00:17:16.070
<i>I came all this way without 
knowing what I should do...</i>

00:17:16.480 --> 00:17:18.760
<i>But they all showed me.</i>

00:17:19.830 --> 00:17:24.520
<i>To fight in order to protect someone... 
is such a magnificent thing.</i>

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:27.350
<i>So...</i>

00:17:27.350 --> 00:17:28.330
<i>Ma.</i>

00:17:32.300 --> 00:17:32.990
<i>Huh?</i>

00:18:08.570 --> 00:18:09.820
Wait...

00:18:11.330 --> 00:18:14.180
That's too fast.

00:18:17.550 --> 00:18:19.000
Ten seconds...

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:41.300
<i>Crap. It got my right eye.</i>

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:44.810
<i>And now I can't hit with my left.</i>

00:18:46.940 --> 00:18:48.810
<i>I think I've done enough.</i>

00:18:49.250 --> 00:18:52.220
<i>Now I want to go home, 
take a bath, and sleep.</i>

00:18:53.080 --> 00:18:54.010
<i>But...</i>

00:18:54.500 --> 00:19:04.600
Sanchez! Sanchez! Sanchez! Sanchez!

00:19:04.600 --> 00:19:06.000
<i>Just a little more...</i>

00:19:06.340 --> 00:19:09.040
<i>Just one more round.</i>

00:19:36.560 --> 00:19:37.570
Keiji...

00:19:39.020 --> 00:19:42.160
<i>I always... I always heard her voice.</i>

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:44.260
Sanchez! Sanchez!

00:19:44.260 --> 00:19:46.350
<i>All of the other voices go silent,</i>

00:19:46.350 --> 00:19:48.520
<i>and I hear the voice I 
shouldn't be able to hear...</i>

00:19:52.890 --> 00:19:57.020
<i>Right now... I should 
have lost everything...</i>

00:19:57.560 --> 00:20:00.840
<i>Everyone should have disappeared...</i>

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:05.510
Next up is Onizuka Keiji-san.

00:20:05.920 --> 00:20:07.580
Onizuka Keiji?

00:20:07.580 --> 00:20:09.060
Whoa, it's really him!

00:20:10.290 --> 00:20:13.960
Um... Are you actually 
<i>the</i> Onizuka Keiji-san?

00:20:13.960 --> 00:20:15.960
What? Onizuka Keiji?!

00:20:15.960 --> 00:20:17.020
You know him?

00:20:18.050 --> 00:20:19.680
Nah...

00:20:19.680 --> 00:20:22.590
He's awesome!

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:24.740
<i>I was happy.</i>

00:20:32.070 --> 00:20:34.330
<i>They said my name.</i>

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:34.960
Keiji.

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:35.710
Onizuka.

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:36.460
Keiji-san.

00:20:36.460 --> 00:20:37.660
What? Onizuka?

00:20:37.660 --> 00:20:38.210
Keiji.

00:20:38.210 --> 00:20:38.960
Keiji-san.

00:20:38.960 --> 00:20:39.710
Onizuka.

00:20:39.710 --> 00:20:40.690
Keiji,

00:20:40.690 --> 00:20:41.670
I'm counting on you.

00:20:42.690 --> 00:20:43.680
Leave it to me.

00:21:22.690 --> 00:21:23.920
I can see it.

00:21:25.230 --> 00:21:27.050
You can't stand anymore.

00:21:27.490 --> 00:21:29.770
Did you learn something, weevil-kun?

00:21:30.290 --> 00:21:32.760
If fighting only involved hitting,

00:21:32.760 --> 00:21:35.180
then hitting without letting 
them hit is a martial art,

00:21:35.180 --> 00:21:36.190
and then

00:21:37.110 --> 00:21:40.390
standing back up within 
ten seconds of being hit

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:42.810
is boxing.

00:21:45.700 --> 00:21:47.930
<i>Four rounds, 47 seconds.</i>

00:21:48.530 --> 00:21:49.870
<i>Knock out.</i>

00:21:54.680 --> 00:21:57.710
<i>You know, the feeling of landing a KO...</i>

00:21:58.660 --> 00:22:00.250
<i>Isn't bad.</i>

00:23:35.080 --> 00:23:40.590
<b><i>On Track and Reckless</i></b>
